              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Essential Travel Tips for First-Time International Travelers\",\n  \"content\": \"<h1>Your Complete Guide to International Travel</h1><p>Traveling internationally for the first time can be overwhelming. Here are essential tips to make your journey smooth...</p><h2>1. Passport and Visa Requirements</h2><p>Ensure your passport is valid for at least 6 months...</p><h2>2. Travel Insurance</h2><p>Never travel without comprehensive travel insurance...</p>\",\n  \"excerpt\": \"Everything you need to know before your first international trip, from documents to packing tips.\",\n  \"category\": \"Travel Tips\",\n  \"author\": \"Jane Smith\",\n  \"imageUrl\": \"https://example.com/travel-tips.jpg\",\n  \"tags\": [\"travel tips\", \"international travel\", \"first time\", \"guide\"],\n  \"readTime\": 12,\n  \"status\": \"published\"\n}"
